  "bodyHtml": "\n                            <div id=\"wrap_img\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; width: 875px; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"><br></p></div><div id=\"wrap_body\" style=\"margin: 10px 20px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.8em;\"><span id=\"ai_cm_content\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">사실&nbsp;오늘은&nbsp;별로&nbsp;만지질&nbsp;못했어요...<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">오늘부터&nbsp;기숙사&nbsp;방&nbsp;빼는&nbsp;날이라서,&nbsp;짐&nbsp;싸고&nbsp;집&nbsp;가느라고&nbsp;코딩&nbsp;할&nbsp;시간은&nbsp;별로&nbsp;없었네요...<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">오늘은&nbsp;파싱&nbsp;작업부터&nbsp;하였습니다.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">nokogiri를&nbsp;이용해서&nbsp;ondada란&nbsp;사이트에서&nbsp;검색&nbsp;결과를&nbsp;불러오다가&nbsp;처음에<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">/home/bada/.rbenv/versions/2.3.0/lib/ruby/2.3.0/uri/rfc3986_parser.rb:21:in&nbsp;`split':&nbsp;URI&nbsp;must&nbsp;be&nbsp;ascii&nbsp;only&nbsp;\"http://onnada.com/search/?t=anime&amp;q=\\u{c544}\\u{c774}\\u{b3cc}\\u{b9c8}\\u{c2a4}\\u{d130}\"&nbsp;(URI::InvalidURIError)<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from&nbsp;/home/bada/.rbenv/versions/2.3.0/lib/ruby/2.3.0/uri/rfc3986_parser.rb:73:in&nbsp;`parse'<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from&nbsp;/home/bada/.rbenv/versions/2.3.0/lib/ruby/2.3.0/uri/common.rb:227:in&nbsp;`parse'<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from&nbsp;/home/bada/.rbenv/versions/2.3.0/lib/ruby/2.3.0/open-uri.rb:34:in&nbsp;`open'<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;from&nbsp;b.rb:9:in&nbsp;`&lt;main&gt;'<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">이런&nbsp;문제가&nbsp;생겨서&nbsp;구글링&nbsp;결과,&nbsp;utf-8변환에서&nbsp;문제가&nbsp;있는&nbsp;것&nbsp;같습니다.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">해결&nbsp;방법으로는&nbsp;<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">require&nbsp;'webrick/httputils'를&nbsp;추가한&nbsp;다음<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">원래&nbsp;주소&nbsp;링크를&nbsp;query라고&nbsp;하면,<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">query.force_encoding('binary')<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">query=WEBrick::HTTPUtils.escape(query)<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">를&nbsp;쓴&nbsp;다음,&nbsp;nokogiri를&nbsp;사용하니까&nbsp;해결되었습니다.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">그래서&nbsp;그&nbsp;결과,</span></div><div id=\"wrap_body\" style=\"margin: 10px 20px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.8em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\" width=\"893\" height=\"269\" filename=\"a9eefe17dcfc5418d9bef1dec9c42ecdfbec9458.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\">\n    <span data-lightbox=\"lightbox\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/posts/2/img-001.png\" width=\"893\" height=\"269\" filename=\"a9eefe17dcfc5418d9bef1dec9c42ecdfbec9458.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" style=\"line-height: normal; text-align: center;\">\n    </span>\n    <figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></span></div><div id=\"wrap_body\" style=\"margin: 10px 20px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.8em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">&nbsp;여기까지&nbsp;출력은&nbsp;완료하였습니다만...&nbsp;파싱을&nbsp;너무&nbsp;노가다적으로&nbsp;하다보니,&nbsp;같은&nbsp;내용을&nbsp;반복해서&nbsp;출력하는&nbsp;문제가&nbsp;생겨서,&nbsp;이&nbsp;문제는&nbsp;내일&nbsp;생각해보는&nbsp;것로...<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">그리고,&nbsp;조금&nbsp;테스트해보고&nbsp;싶다는&nbsp;생각으로&nbsp;Ruby&nbsp;on&nbsp;Rails에서&nbsp;Firebase가&nbsp;되는지&nbsp;검색해봤습니다.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">그&nbsp;결과,&nbsp;누가&nbsp;gem으로&nbsp;만들어놨더라고요.&nbsp;영상을&nbsp;보니까&nbsp;일단&nbsp;채팅&nbsp;기능을&nbsp;구현할&nbsp;수는&nbsp;있을&nbsp;것&nbsp;같습니다.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">그런데,&nbsp;제가&nbsp;원하던&nbsp;auth&nbsp;인증&nbsp;기능은&nbsp;조금&nbsp;더&nbsp;조사해봐야할&nbsp;듯&nbsp;합니다.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">그리고,&nbsp;협업필터링에&nbsp;대해&nbsp;검색해보다가&nbsp;어떤&nbsp;사람이&nbsp;Rails와&nbsp;하둡으로&nbsp;협업필터링&nbsp;기반의&nbsp;영화추천시스템을&nbsp;구현한&nbsp;걸&nbsp;논문으로&nbsp;쓴&nbsp;게&nbsp;있더라고요.</span></div><div id=\"wrap_body\" style=\"margin: 10px 20px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; font-family: dotum, 돋움, gulim, 굴림, Helvetica, Apple-Gothic, sans-serif, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.8em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">(<a href=\"http://www.eiric.or.kr/KeyDocs/tmp/FN_1512150182342.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">http://www.eiric.or.kr/KeyDocs/tmp/FN_1512150182342.pdf</a>)<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">한&nbsp;번&nbsp;자세히&nbsp;보고&nbsp;이를&nbsp;기반으로&nbsp;해볼&nbsp;생각입니다.<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">그런데,&nbsp;일단&nbsp;프론트엔드부터&nbsp;작업해야할&nbsp;듯&nbsp;해서...<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px;\">일단&nbsp;오늘까지의&nbsp;과정은&nbsp;여기까지였습니다!!&nbsp;그러면&nbsp;내일도&nbsp;작업하도록&nbsp;하겠습니다^^</span></div><p><br></p>\n                        ",
